      "patch": "@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@\n <img src=\"https://github.com/ClimSocAna/climademic_suitability_model/blob/main/logo.jpg\">\n \n ## About\n-This repository contains the workflow pipeline for training and inferencing the Climademic Suitability Model, as described in [Suitable seasons: Global monthly habitat suitability for the arbovirus vectors Aedes aegypti and Aedes albopictus in 1975–2024 (bioRxiv)](https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.04.17.719149). The model combines One-Class Support Vector Machines (OC-SVM) with an incremental learning strategy to continuously update suitability predictions using newly available mosquito occurrence observations.\n+This repository contains the workflow pipeline for training and inferencing the Climademic Suitability Model, as described in [Suitable seasons: Global monthly habitat suitability for the arbovirus vectors Aedes aegypti and Aedes albopictus in 1975–2024 (bioRxiv)](https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.04.17.719149). The model combines One-Class Support Vector Machines (OC-SVM) with an incremental learning strategy to continuously update suitability predictions using newly available mosquito occurrence observations. The full habitat suitability data set is available via [Zenodo](https://zenodo.org/records/21924442).\n \n ## Workflow Overview\n "
